  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    AI Preview Agent Inspect lets an AI agent see a running Lens in the Lens Studio Preview: it answers scene queries and renders orthographic captures.
    
    There is nothing to press here. The agent tools talk to the AgentInspectScript object in this scene, and the component does nothing on device.
